OL,3,GNEWSAAmbika Mod says the 'glass ceiling
OL,4,Ais always getting higher' for South
OL,5,AAsian actors
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn overworked junior doctor, an
OL,8,Faspiring writer and now a ruthless
OL,9,Fassassin.
OL,11,FAmbika Mod's TV credits are becoming as
OL,12,Fdiverse as the roles are complex.
OL,14,FThe actress broke through as the
OL,15,Foverwhelmed Shruti in BBC medical drama
OL,16,FThis Is Going To Hurt in 2022, and
OL,17,Fgained wide recognition for her
OL,18,Fstarring role as Emma Morley in
OL,19,FNetflix's miniseries adaptation of
OL,20,FDavid Nicholls' bestselling novel One
OL,21,FDay.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
